t:5(Option,Description,Default)[`--url <url>`,Gateway WebSocket URL,`ws://127.0.0.1:18789` `--token <token>`,Gateway auth token,From `~/.openclaw/openclaw.json` `--session <key>`,Session identifier,`main` `--model <model>`,AI model to use,From config `--deliver`,Send to channels,`false`]
## How It Works
```
┌──────────────┐
│   User       │
│   Terminal   │
└──────┬───────┘
       │ (readline input)
       ↓
┌──────────────┐
│  Chat CLI    │ ← openclaw-standalone/src/cli/chat-cli.ts
└──────┬───────┘
       │ (WebSocket)
       ↓
┌──────────────┐
│   Gateway    │ ← Running on ws://127.0.0.1:18789
└──────┬───────┘
       │
       ↓
┌──────────────┐
│  AI Agent    │ ← Uses configured model/provider
│  (Gemini,    │
│   Claude,    │
│   etc.)      │
└──────────────┘
```
